Package: Roryza
Description: An implementation of the ORYZA2000 rice crop growth model. ORYZA2000 is a dynamic simulation model that uses daily weather data and crop, soil and management parameters to simulate rice growth and development. See Bouman et al. (2001) ORYZA2000: modeling lowland rice. IRRI / Wageningen University.
Type: Package
Title: ORYZA2000 Rice Crop Growth Simulation Model
